no-op states; adversarial instances reorder callbacks and interleave edits; shift instances use longer traces/more identities within the same rules. These tasks test controller state/effects only, not visual quality, browser integration or screen-reader usability. ","tags":["thresholds","visibility","reversibility","ordering"],"title":"Staged bounded numeric input"}
